#: src/Privacy.php:125
msgid "This store sends parcels with Poczta Polska S.A. To register a shipment, the recipient name, delivery address, phone number, email address and, for cash on delivery, the amount are sent to Poczta Polska through its Elektroniczny Nadawca service. Poczta Polska processes them to deliver the parcel and to notify the recipient."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:126
msgid "When you choose a pickup point or a parcel locker, the Poczta Polska map is loaded from mapa.ecommerce.poczta-polska.pl. Your browser sends your IP address, your delivery address (to centre the map) and the address you search for to Poczta Polska. The chosen point is saved in your order."
msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy.php:127
msgid "The store keeps the tracking numbers of your parcels with the order. Recipient data stays in the order; the plugin keeps only phone numbers that the store corrected for a shipment, and removes them together with the order data."
